// 同源编译耗时的 ABBA/BAAB 墙钟对照：两臂（基线与候选编译器）编同一批负载，产物须逐字节相同，各取墙钟中位数，候选/基线不超过
// 1.03 记 PASS。墙钟受调度与频率影响（同一二进制 A/A 可差 ±11%），判退化以
// perf_compare.tx 的指令数为准；本脚本用于“改了编译器自身、产物应不变”的优化，看用户实际等待的时间。
//
// 每个样本由 perf_lib.tx 的帮手进程起编译器，墙钟从起子进程到它退出；子进程的环境去掉 TAIXU_* 变量（置空）、PATH 指向空目录。
// --kernel 让两臂都以 --link-object 链同一个内核对象（缺省用各自内嵌的内核）。--cpu 把本进程及子进程固定在一个逻辑 CPU 上，并核对
// 每个编译器进程实际的集合（macOS 不支持）。
//
//   taixu run --toolchain scripts/compiler_regression.tx --baseline <基线编译器> --compiler <候选编译器> --work <新目录>
//       [--kernel <内核对象>] [--runs 7] [--only lexer|all] [--cpu N] [--root <仓库根>]
import { cleanEnv, cpuList, cpuPolicy, fixed, isPerfHelper, jBool, jFloat, median, perfHelperMain, perfMeasure, privateExe } from "./perf_lib";
import { absolute, baseOf, exeName, join, kindOf, mkdirs, parseDigits, shaOf } from "./build_lib";
import { Jv, jArray, jGet, jNull, jNumber, jObject, jPretty, jPush, jSet, jString } from "./test_json";

const USAGE: string = "用法：compiler_regression --baseline <基线编译器> --compiler <候选编译器> --work <新目录> [--kernel <内核对象>]"
+ " [--runs 7] [--only lexer|all] [--cpu N] [--root <仓库根>]";
const LIMIT_MS: int = 120000;

struct Opts {
    baseline: string,
    compiler: string,
    kernel: string,
    runs: int,
    work: string,
    only: string,
    cpu: int,
    root: string,
}

function parse(argv: []string): Ref<Opts> | Error {
    const o = new Opts { baseline: "", compiler: "", kernel: "", runs: 7, work: "", only: "all", cpu: -1, root: "" };
    let i = 0;
    while (i + 1 < len(argv)) {
        const a = argv[i];
        const v = argv[i + 1];
        if (a == "--baseline") {
            o.baseline = absolute(v);
        } else if (a == "--compiler") {
            o.compiler = absolute(v);
        } else if (a == "--kernel") {
            o.kernel = absolute(v);
        } else if (a == "--runs") {
            o.runs = parseDigits(v);
        } else if (a == "--work") {
            o.work = absolute(v);
        } else if (a == "--only") {
            o.only = v;
        } else if (a == "--cpu") {
            o.cpu = parseDigits(v);
            if (o.cpu < 0) {
                return err("--cpu 须为非负整数");
            }
        } else if (a == "--root") {
            o.root = absolute(v);
        } else {
            return err(USAGE);
        }
        i = i + 2;
    }
    if (i != len(argv) || len(o.baseline) == 0 || len(o.compiler) == 0 || len(o.work) == 0) {
        return err(USAGE);
    }
    if (o.runs < 5) {
        return err("--runs 至少 5");
    }
    if (o.only != "lexer" && o.only != "all") {
        return err("--only 取 lexer 或 all");
    }
    if (len(o.root) == 0) {
        o.root = absolute(currentDir() catch ".");
    }
    return o;
}

function stemOf(load: string): string {
    const b = baseOf(load);
    return strSlice(b, 0, len(b) - 3);
}

function armOrder(r: int): List<string> {
    if (r == -1) {
        return strSplit("old new", " ");
    }
    if (r % 2 == 0) {
        return strSplit("old new new old", " ");
    }
    return strSplit("new old old new", " ");
}

function run(o: Ref<Opts>, doc: Ref<Jv>): bool | Error {
    const loads = jGet(doc, "loads") ?? doc;
    let names = "bootstrap/lexer.tx bootstrap/parser.tx bootstrap/semamirror.tx";
    if (o.only == "lexer") {
        names = "bootstrap/lexer.tx";
    }
    let allPass = true;
    for (load in strSplit(names, " ")) {
        const stem = stemOf(load);
        const oldNs: List<float> = listNew();
        const newNs: List<float> = listNew();
        const rows = jArray();
        let expected = "";
        let r = -1;
        while (r < o.runs) {
            let k = 0;
            for (arm in armOrder(r)) {
                const dest = join(join(o.work, stem), toStr(r) + "-" + toStr(k) + "-" + arm);
                if (!mkdirs(dest)) {
                    return err("建不了 " + dest);
                }
                let exe = o.baseline;
                if (arm == "new") {
                    exe = o.compiler;
                }
                const args: List<string> = listNew();
                listPush(args, "build");
                listPush(args, load);
                // 编译器源码按工具链程序编（v0.51 起两种模式下 byteAt、listGet 等签名不同）。
                listPush(args, "--toolchain");
                if (len(o.kernel) > 0) {
                    listPush(args, "--link-object");
                    listPush(args, o.kernel);
                }
                listPush(args, "--out");
                listPush(args, dest);
                const s = perfMeasure(exe, args, o.root, LIMIT_MS);
                if (len(s.error) > 0) {
                    return err(arm + " 臂编 " + load + " 测不了：" + s.error);
                }
                if (s.exit != 0) {
                    return err(arm + " 臂编 " + load + " 失败（退出码 " + toStr(s.exit) + "）：" + s.stderr);
                }
                if (o.cpu >= 0 && s.cpus != toStr(o.cpu)) {
                    return err("子进程未继承指定 CPU：" + s.cpus);
                }
                const digest = shaOf(join(dest, exeName(stem)));
                if (len(expected) == 0) {
                    expected = digest;
                }
                if (digest != expected) {
                    return err(load + " 的 " + arm + " 臂产物与先前不同：" + digest + " ≠ " + expected);
                }
                const row = jObject();
                jSet(row, "round", jNumber(r));
                jSet(row, "arm", jString(arm));
                jSet(row, "ns", jNumber(s.wallNs));
                jSet(row, "sha", jString(digest));
                if (o.cpu >= 0) {
                    jSet(row, "cpu_affinity", cpuList(s.cpus));
                }
                jPush(rows, row);
                if (r >= 0) {
                    if (arm == "old") {
                        listPush(oldNs, s.wallNs as float);
                    } else {
                        listPush(newNs, s.wallNs as float);
                    }
                }
                k = k + 1;
            }
            r = r + 1;
        }
        const mo = median(oldNs);
        const mn = median(newNs);
        const ratio = mn / mo;
        const ok = ratio <= 1.03;
        const med = jObject();
        jSet(med, "old", jFloat(mo));
        jSet(med, "new", jFloat(mn));
        const entry = jObject();
        jSet(entry, "input_sha", jString(shaOf(join(o.root, load))));
        jSet(entry, "samples", rows);
        jSet(entry, "medians_ns", med);
        jSet(entry, "ratio", jFloat(ratio));
        jSet(entry, "pass", jBool(ok));
        jSet(loads, load, entry);
        save(o, doc);
        let verdict = "FAIL";
        if (ok) {
            verdict = "PASS";
        } else {
            allPass = false;
        }
        print(load + " ratio " + toStr(ratio) + " delta " + fixed((ratio - 1.0) * 100.0, 3, true) + "% " + verdict);
    }
    return allPass;
}

function save(o: Ref<Opts>, doc: Ref<Jv>): void {
    writeFile(join(o.work, "report.json"), jPretty(doc, 2) + "\n") catch (e) {
        eprint("写不了 report.json：" + e.message);
    };
}

function main(argv: []string): int {
    if (isPerfHelper(argv)) {
        return perfHelperMain(argv);
    }
    const o = parse(argv) catch (e) {
        eprint(e.message);
        return 2;
    };
    if (kindOf(o.work) != 0) {
        eprint("--work 须是新目录：" + o.work);
        return 2;
    }
    const empty = join(o.work, "empty-path");
    if (!mkdirs(empty)) {
        eprint("建不了 " + empty);
        return 2;
    }
    const policy = cpuPolicy(o.cpu) catch (e) {
        eprint(e.message);
        return 2;
    };
    cleanEnv(empty) catch (e) {
        eprint("改不了环境：" + e.message);
        return 2;
    };
    // Windows 上两臂的编译器先复制进工作目录再测（perf_lib 的 privateExe）。
    o.baseline = privateExe(o.baseline, join(o.work, "arm-old")) catch (e) {
        eprint(e.message);
        return 2;
    };
    o.compiler = privateExe(o.compiler, join(o.work, "arm-new")) catch (e) {
        eprint(e.message);
        return 2;
    };
    const doc = jObject();
    const compilers = jObject();
    jSet(compilers, "old", jString(shaOf(o.baseline)));
    jSet(compilers, "new", jString(shaOf(o.compiler)));
    jSet(doc, "compilers", compilers);
    jSet(doc, "N", jNumber(o.runs));
    if (len(o.kernel) > 0) {
        jSet(doc, "kernel_sha256", jString(shaOf(o.kernel)));
    } else {
        jSet(doc, "kernel_sha256", jNull());
    }
    jSet(doc, "host", jString(hostTarget()));
    jSet(doc, "order", jString("ABBA, then BAAB; one excluded warmup per arm and load"));
    jSet(doc, "clock", jString("helper monotonic ns, spawn through exit"));
    jSet(doc, "path", jString("empty"));
    jSet(doc, "cpu_policy", policy);
    jSet(doc, "priority_policy", jString("unchanged"));
    jSet(doc, "loads", jObject());
    const ok = run(o, doc) catch (e) {
        jSet(doc, "status", jString("FAIL"));
        jSet(doc, "error", jString(e.message));
        save(o, doc);
        eprint(e.message);
        return 1;
    };
    let status = "FAIL";
    if (ok) {
        status = "PASS";
    }
    jSet(doc, "status", jString(status));
    save(o, doc);
    print("STATUS " + status);
    if (ok) {
        return 0;
    }
    return 1;
}
